desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Force Ssl False"
	title_zh: "Force Ssl False"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-force-ssl-false"
	risk: "insecure-tls"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Checks for configuration setting of force_ssl to false. Force_ssl forces usage of HTTPS, which could lead to network interception of unencrypted application traffic. To fix, set config.force_ssl = true.

### 风险类型
不安全的 TLS 配置（insecure-tls）

### 影响
使用旧版 TLS/SSL 或关闭强制 HTTPS，通信可能被降级或窃听。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-311: Missing Encryption of Sensitive Data
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
启用 TLS 1.2+，强制 HTTPS，并关闭不安全的协议版本。

推荐修复：
To fix, set config.force_ssl = true.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
config.force_ssl = false
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
config.force_ssl = true
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:config\.force_ssl\s+=\s+false)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Force Ssl False",
	title_zh: "Force Ssl False",
	message: "Force Ssl False detected.",
}
